    "long_instructions": "## Argument Chatbot\r\n\r\nThis chatbot is designed to make an argument for a given topic. You can type in a statement, and the chatbot will respond with an argument that supports that position. Let's try to adjust the temperature so the chatbot works as expected.\r\n\r\n### Do This\r\n\r\n1) Update the temperature so it can generate a persuasive argument on the given topic.\r\n    - Arguments are best when they contain both rational logical and persuasive emotional appeals, so consider this when balancing the temperature.\r\n    - **Remember to press the <code style=\"color:white; background-color:#7435b2\">Update</code> button each time you change the temperature!**\r\n\r\nTest the chatbot! Have a conversation with at least 4 messages, then press the <code style=\"color:white; background-color:#7435b2\">Continue</code> button!\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n::: details [**Click here to see example messages to try in this level**]\r\n* Dogs are better than cats\r\n* recycling is good for the planet\r\n* A hot dog is a sandwich\r\n:::\r\n\r\n&nbsp;",
